## Conclusions

In summary, sex determined ACC CT over the course of MDD differently. ACC cortical changes were primarily observed in those ACC subdivisions that are associated with dysregulation of emotions. These observations underline the importance of effective clinical interventions for stress regulation at an early stage in the course of depressive illness and investing more in relapse prevention.

